Welcome back code monkeys! Today we will be building a simple yet effective way to showcase our AWS skills, suitable for beginners exploring what the Cloud has to offer. In this project, we will be deploying a static website with a custom domain name, which will take about 15-20 minutes to complete



What will we need?

An [AWS account](https://signin.aws.amazon.com/signup?request_type=register)

Access to [Route 53
](https://aws.amazon.com/route53/)

An empty [S3  #bucket](https://aws.amazon.com/s3/)


How much will it cost?

Most of this will use AWS free tier and should only invoke little to no cost. Feel free to use [AWS pricing calculator ](https://calculator.aws/#/)for more in-depth information.

